[{"text": "Hello, everyone. Welcome back to EnglishPod. My name is Marco.", "start": 1.4199999999999995, "end": 5.04}, {"text": "And I'm Erica.", "start": 5.28, "end": 6.1}, {"text": "And today we're bringing you the second part of Christmas Chronicles.", "start": 6.48, "end": 10.54}, {"text": "Another Christmas lesson to get you in the Christmas spirit.", "start": 10.76, "end": 14.5}, {"text": "Christmas and useful language for all of our listeners today.", "start": 15.34, "end": 19.22}, {"text": "That's right. In today's lesson, we'll be learning some great Christmas vocabulary.", "start": 19.54, "end": 23.78}, {"text": "And police-related vocabulary as well.", "start": 24.2, "end": 26.9}, {"text": "Now, Christmas, police vocabulary, how exactly does that fit together?", "start": 26.9, "end": 31.8}, {"text": "Well, they don't. But here at EnglishPod, we can make anything happen.", "start": 32.440000000000005, "end": 37.2}, {"text": "So that's why we have done this.", "start": 37.2, "end": 38.76}, {"text": "To be creative.", "start": 38.94, "end": 39.64}, {"text": "To be creative. So let's take a look at our vocabulary preview for this lesson.", "start": 39.86, "end": 43.88}, {"text": "Vocabulary preview.", "start": 44.92000000000001, "end": 46.04}, {"text": "In today's vocabulary preview, we've got two words from our dialogue", "start": 46.58, "end": 50.24}, {"text": "that you will need to know to understand this dialogue.", "start": 50.24, "end": 53.08}, {"text": "The first one is elves.", "start": 53.44, "end": 55.82}, {"text": "Elves.", "start": 55.82, "end": 55.94}, {"text": "Elves.", "start": 57.160000000000004, "end": 57.84}, {"text": "Elves.", "start": 58.02, "end": 58.38}, {"text": "Elves. And this is the plural of the word elf.", "start": 58.38, "end": 61.2}, {"text": "Elf. Right.", "start": 61.44, "end": 62.08}, {"text": "So elves are?", "start": 62.52, "end": 64.22}, {"text": "Little people.", "start": 64.46, "end": 65.5}, {"text": "Little people with pointy hats?", "start": 65.88, "end": 68.06}, {"text": "With pointy hats.", "start": 68.18, "end": 69.0}, {"text": "Census helpers.", "start": 69.16, "end": 70.04}, {"text": "Okay. So elves.", "start": 70.26, "end": 71.52}, {"text": "Elves.", "start": 71.8, "end": 72.24}, {"text": "Our next word is candy cane.", "start": 72.38, "end": 74.7}, {"text": "Candy cane.", "start": 75.04, "end": 76.06}, {"text": "Candy cane.", "start": 76.36, "end": 77.26}, {"text": "Candy cane.", "start": 77.6, "end": 78.36}, {"text": "So a candy cane is a traditional Christmas candy, right?", "start": 78.36, "end": 82.04}, {"text": "Yes. It's red and white.", "start": 82.54, "end": 84.62}, {"text": "And kind of shaped like a J?", "start": 84.86, "end": 86.98}, {"text": "Like a J, yeah.", "start": 87.24, "end": 88.26}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 88.46, "end": 88.78}, {"text": "It's very traditional.", "start": 88.9, "end": 89.86}, {"text": "Yeah, you hang them on the tree and you eat them at Christmas time.", "start": 90.12, "end": 93.24}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 93.42, "end": 93.62}, {"text": "Tastes like peppermint.", "start": 93.74, "end": 94.64}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 94.64, "end": 95.2}, {"text": "Well, I guess we're ready to listen to our dialogue for the first time.", "start": 95.44, "end": 98.68}, {"text": "And it's going to be kind of fast, but...", "start": 99.5, "end": 101.7}, {"text": "Don't worry if you don't understand everything because we'll come back and talk about some", "start": 101.7, "end": 105.44}, {"text": "of the language later.", "start": 105.44, "end": 106.4}, {"text": "Really, fellas?", "start": 115.66, "end": 116.56}, {"text": "You can't take me to jail?", "start": 116.84, "end": 118.26}, {"text": "Don't you know who I am?", "start": 118.6, "end": 119.98}, {"text": "Kris Kringle, you know.", "start": 120.3, "end": 121.56}, {"text": "Papa Noel.", "start": 121.92, "end": 122.8}, {"text": "Perry Noel.", "start": 123.12, "end": 123.72}, {"text": "Baba Natale.", "start": 124.1, "end": 124.92}, {"text": "Shung down, Lord.", "start": 125.2, "end": 125.72}, {"text": "Yeah, yeah.", "start": 126.06, "end": 126.84}, {"text": "We've heard that one before, haven't we, Joe?", "start": 126.84, "end": 129.04}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 129.68, "end": 130.1}, {"text": "Last week, we booked this guy who claimed to be a tooth fairy.", "start": 130.32, "end": 132.68}, {"text": "Can you believe that?", "start": 132.94, "end": 133.88}, {"text": "It's Christmas Eve and I have all these presents to deliver.", "start": 135.64, "end": 138.96}, {"text": "Where's your Christmas spirit?", "start": 139.68, "end": 141.24}, {"text": "What'll happen when all the children wake up tomorrow and don't find any gifts in their", "start": 141.68, "end": 146.2}, {"text": "stockings?", "start": 146.2, "end": 146.84}, {"text": "Sorry, buddy.", "start": 147.58, "end": 148.44}, {"text": "You're parked in a no-parking zone.", "start": 148.56, "end": 150.1}, {"text": "You were speeding and you have no ID.", "start": 150.22, "end": 152.82}, {"text": "Besides that, even if we let you go now, your sleigh's been impounded and those reindeer", "start": 153.58, "end": 157.7}, {"text": "were taken to the city zoo.", "start": 157.7, "end": 158.82}, {"text": "What?", "start": 159.82, "end": 160.34}, {"text": "This is unbelievable.", "start": 161.06, "end": 162.48}, {"text": "What's this world coming to?", "start": 163.2, "end": 165.06}, {"text": "Christmas is ruined.", "start": 165.5, "end": 167.04}, {"text": "What's that up ahead?", "start": 167.5, "end": 168.46}, {"text": "It looks like...", "start": 168.7, "end": 169.48}, {"text": "Elves!", "start": 170.64, "end": 171.26}, {"text": "Whoa!", "start": 171.74, "end": 172.32}, {"text": "They're shooting candy canes!", "start": 172.58, "end": 173.68}, {"text": "Mayday!", "start": 174.38, "end": 174.84}, {"text": "Mayday!", "start": 174.96, "end": 175.26}, {"text": "We're under heavy attack!", "start": 175.36, "end": 176.2}, {"text": "We need backup!", "start": 176.38, "end": 177.02}, {"text": "Santa!", "start": 179.39999999999998, "end": 180.04}, {"text": "", "start": 180.26, "end": 180.26}, {"text": "", "start": 180.58, "end": 180.58}, {"text": "It's coming straight to the ghetto.", "start": 184.06, "end": 186.16}, {"text": "Okay, so Santa has escaped from the police car, eh?", "start": 190.12, "end": 193.84}, {"text": "Thank God!", "start": 194.04, "end": 194.64}, {"text": "It's like a war over there.", "start": 195.14, "end": 196.88}, {"text": "They were really firing everything.", "start": 197.0, "end": 198.62}, {"text": "I know.", "start": 198.78, "end": 199.22}, {"text": "I mean, those elves are...", "start": 199.42, "end": 201.6}, {"text": "Aggressive.", "start": 201.6, "end": 202.3}, {"text": "Very aggressive.", "start": 202.6, "end": 203.48}, {"text": "Okay, well, we can take a look at some great vocabulary from this dialogue.", "start": 204.44, "end": 208.68}, {"text": "Why don't we start with our language takeaway for today?", "start": 209.04, "end": 211.78}, {"text": "Language takeaway.", "start": 213.08, "end": 214.3}, {"text": "In today's language takeaway, we have five really important words that we hope you will take away from the lesson.", "start": 215.12, "end": 223.18}, {"text": "Exactly. And the first word that we have today is booked.", "start": 223.5, "end": 227.04}, {"text": "Booked.", "start": 227.58, "end": 228.22}, {"text": "Booked.", "start": 228.76, "end": 229.3}, {"text": "Booked.", "start": 229.5, "end": 230.14}, {"text": "Booked is another way of saying?", "start": 230.28, "end": 231.94}, {"text": "Arrested.", "start": 232.22, "end": 232.86}, {"text": "Arrested.", "start": 232.86, "end": 233.46}, {"text": "Yeah, it's a slang word, hey?", "start": 233.6, "end": 234.94}, {"text": "It's kind of slangy, yeah. Yeah, it's a slang word. Booked.", "start": 235.14, "end": 238.18}, {"text": "Okay, next word. Speeding.", "start": 238.44, "end": 240.46}, {"text": "Speeding.", "start": 240.7, "end": 241.14}, {"text": "Speeding.", "start": 241.44, "end": 242.0}, {"text": "Speeding.", "start": 242.76, "end": 243.32}, {"text": "So Santa was speeding because he was...", "start": 243.58, "end": 246.02}, {"text": "Going too fast.", "start": 246.02, "end": 247.28}, {"text": "Driving too fast, yeah.", "start": 247.42, "end": 248.38}, {"text": "Going over the speed limit.", "start": 248.64, "end": 250.18}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 250.36, "end": 250.76}, {"text": "Third word today is...", "start": 251.54, "end": 252.86}, {"text": "Impounded.", "start": 253.76, "end": 254.32}, {"text": "Impounded.", "start": 255.3, "end": 255.86}, {"text": "Impounded.", "start": 257.02, "end": 257.58}, {"text": "That's when your car gets arrested.", "start": 258.12, "end": 260.04}, {"text": "Your car gets arrested.", "start": 260.28, "end": 261.62}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 262.20000000000005, "end": 262.72}, {"text": "They take your car to car jail.", "start": 263.2, "end": 264.86}, {"text": "Okay, so my car is in car jail. I think I understand.", "start": 265.36, "end": 268.92}, {"text": "It's impounded.", "start": 269.16, "end": 270.08}, {"text": "Okay, so the police take my car and I have to...", "start": 270.44, "end": 273.9}, {"text": "Pay to get it out.", "start": 273.9, "end": 275.14}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 275.36, "end": 275.64}, {"text": "Let's move to our next word.", "start": 276.20000000000005, "end": 277.86}, {"text": "Ruined.", "start": 278.54, "end": 279.06}, {"text": "Ruined.", "start": 279.78000000000003, "end": 280.3}, {"text": "Ruined.", "start": 281.0, "end": 281.52}, {"text": "Ruined.", "start": 282.34000000000003, "end": 282.86}, {"text": "We have a few examples for us to listen to to understand the meaning of this word.", "start": 282.86, "end": 287.92}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 289.0, "end": 290.1}, {"text": "It's been raining for five days.", "start": 291.66, "end": 294.3}, {"text": "Our vacation is ruined.", "start": 294.62, "end": 296.44}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 299.98, "end": 301.02}, {"text": "Look at this hole.", "start": 304.5, "end": 306.0}, {"text": "You've ruined my favorite pair of jeans.", "start": 306.0, "end": 309.0}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 312.64, "end": 313.68}, {"text": "Sam, you've been caught stealing from the company.", "start": 316.65999999999997, "end": 319.48}, {"text": "Your chances for a promotion are ruined.", "start": 319.8, "end": 321.46}, {"text": "Ruined.", "start": 325.46, "end": 326.08}, {"text": "Okay, great examples.", "start": 326.08, "end": 327.2}, {"text": "And basically ruined means...", "start": 327.5, "end": 329.42}, {"text": "Destroyed.", "start": 329.42, "end": 330.2}, {"text": "Destroyed.", "start": 330.26, "end": 330.72}, {"text": "Yeah, messed up.", "start": 330.8, "end": 331.4}, {"text": "Messed up.", "start": 331.52, "end": 332.02}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 332.14, "end": 332.4}, {"text": "Now for our last word.", "start": 332.8, "end": 334.8}, {"text": "Back up.", "start": 335.24, "end": 336.24}, {"text": "Back up.", "start": 337.24, "end": 338.08}, {"text": "Oh yeah.", "start": 338.44, "end": 338.7}, {"text": "So now for our last word.", "start": 338.88, "end": 340.56}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 341.92, "end": 342.54}, {"text": "So now for our last word and language takeaway.", "start": 342.74, "end": 345.48}, {"text": "Back up.", "start": 346.08, "end": 346.8}, {"text": "Back up.", "start": 346.96, "end": 347.6}, {"text": "Back up.", "start": 347.84, "end": 348.6}, {"text": "Back up.", "start": 348.76, "end": 349.42}, {"text": "Back up.", "start": 349.94, "end": 350.38}, {"text": "So back up is...", "start": 350.38, "end": 351.3}, {"text": "Help.", "start": 351.3, "end": 351.58}, {"text": "Help.", "start": 351.78, "end": 352.06}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 352.3, "end": 352.44}, {"text": "Right?", "start": 352.58, "end": 352.78}, {"text": "So when you call for back up, you call for help.", "start": 353.0, "end": 355.6}, {"text": "Yeah, you see it all the time in war movies, police.", "start": 355.8, "end": 358.06}, {"text": "Call for back up.", "start": 358.34, "end": 359.08}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 359.24, "end": 359.4}, {"text": "Right?", "start": 359.68, "end": 359.82}, {"text": "I think though it's important to point out that here the pronunciation and stress of this", "start": 360.02, "end": 365.7}, {"text": "phrase is really important, hey?", "start": 365.7, "end": 367.28}, {"text": "Yes, yes.", "start": 367.4, "end": 368.06}, {"text": "You have to say back up.", "start": 368.22, "end": 369.82}, {"text": "Back up.", "start": 370.08, "end": 370.7}, {"text": "Back up.", "start": 370.86, "end": 371.34}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 371.56, "end": 371.72}, {"text": "So both words are stressed at about the same level, hey?", "start": 372.0, "end": 375.18}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 375.34, "end": 375.6}, {"text": "Back up.", "start": 375.84, "end": 376.34}, {"text": "Because if you were to say back up...", "start": 376.6, "end": 379.04}, {"text": "Back up.", "start": 379.04, "end": 379.4}, {"text": "Means to move back.", "start": 379.4, "end": 380.94}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 381.12, "end": 381.5}, {"text": "Yeah, it's different.", "start": 381.84, "end": 382.48}, {"text": "So back up, back up.", "start": 382.68, "end": 384.78}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 385.06, "end": 385.46}, {"text": "The stress is important.", "start": 385.78, "end": 386.76}, {"text": "The stress.", "start": 387.2, "end": 387.3}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 387.46, "end": 387.86}, {"text": "Well, you know what?", "start": 388.02, "end": 389.04}, {"text": "I think with those words in mind, it's time for us to listen to the dialogue a second time.", "start": 389.04, "end": 393.62}, {"text": "Really, fellas?", "start": 399.17999999999995, "end": 400.4}, {"text": "You can't take me to jail.", "start": 400.86, "end": 402.84}, {"text": "Don't you know who I am?", "start": 403.26, "end": 405.16}, {"text": "Kris Kringle, you know?", "start": 405.52, "end": 407.48}, {"text": "Papa Noel.", "start": 407.48, "end": 408.48}, {"text": "Papa Noel.", "start": 409.48, "end": 410.02}, {"text": "Papa Natale.", "start": 410.02, "end": 411.82}, {"text": "Shandang, lao ren.", "start": 412.14, "end": 413.16}, {"text": "Yeah, yeah.", "start": 414.1, "end": 415.2}, {"text": "We've heard that one before.", "start": 415.24, "end": 417.22}, {"text": "Haven't we, Joe?", "start": 417.54, "end": 418.56}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 419.08, "end": 419.48}, {"text": "Last week, we booked this guy who claimed to be the tooth fairy.", "start": 420.0, "end": 423.32}, {"text": "Can you believe that?", "start": 423.56, "end": 424.68}, {"text": "Ha ha ha!", "start": 424.98, "end": 425.72}, {"text": "Ha ha ha!", "start": 425.84, "end": 425.94}, {"text": "It's Christmas Eve, and I have all these presents to deliver.", "start": 426.86, "end": 430.72}, {"text": "Where's your Christmas spirit?", "start": 431.28, "end": 433.12}, {"text": "What will happen when all the children wake up tomorrow and don't find any gifts in their stockings?", "start": 433.42, "end": 439.5}, {"text": "Sorry, buddy.", "start": 440.16, "end": 440.98}, {"text": "You were parked in a no-parking zone.", "start": 441.3, "end": 443.36}, {"text": "You were speeding, and you have no ID.", "start": 443.36, "end": 447.06}, {"text": "Besides that, even if we let you go now, your sleigh has been impounded, and those reindeer were taken to the city zoo.", "start": 447.78, "end": 455.72}, {"text": "What?", "start": 456.74, "end": 457.34}, {"text": "This is unbelievable.", "start": 457.72, "end": 459.24}, {"text": "What's the world coming to?", "start": 459.82, "end": 461.8}, {"text": "Christmas is ruined.", "start": 462.2, "end": 463.86}, {"text": "What's that up ahead?", "start": 465.12, "end": 466.32}, {"text": "It looks like elves.", "start": 466.88, "end": 468.74}, {"text": "Whoa, they're shooting candy canes.", "start": 469.53999999999996, "end": 471.62}, {"text": "Mayday!", "start": 472.78, "end": 473.26}, {"text": "Mayday!", "start": 473.7, "end": 474.18}, {"text": "We are under heavy attack.", "start": 474.46, "end": 475.88}, {"text": "We need backup.", "start": 476.2, "end": 477.34}, {"text": "Okay, so without the sound effects and without any noise, I think it's much more clear now, right?", "start": 481.94, "end": 487.8}, {"text": "A little less dramatic.", "start": 487.92, "end": 489.06}, {"text": "Less dramatic, but good language.", "start": 489.34, "end": 491.62}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 491.86, "end": 492.1}, {"text": "Speaking of good language, there's some great phrases I want to look at in this dialogue.", "start": 492.36, "end": 495.66}, {"text": "And so let's do that in Putting It Together.", "start": 495.66, "end": 497.74}, {"text": "Putting It Together.", "start": 499.76, "end": 500.84}, {"text": "We have two phrases in Putting It Together that we want to show you how you can use in many different situations.", "start": 502.32, "end": 509.14}, {"text": "In the dialogue, we heard this.", "start": 509.58, "end": 511.76}, {"text": "Last week, we booked this guy who claimed to be a tooth fairy.", "start": 512.58, "end": 515.14}, {"text": "Last week, we booked this guy who claimed to be a tooth fairy.", "start": 516.26, "end": 518.86}, {"text": "So when you claim to be something, you're saying that you are something, but it might not be true, right?", "start": 519.64, "end": 525.26}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 525.48, "end": 525.7}, {"text": "So for example, you can say, this woman claimed to be your wife.", "start": 525.86, "end": 530.06}, {"text": "But she's not.", "start": 530.22, "end": 531.08}, {"text": "But she's not.", "start": 531.26, "end": 531.72}, {"text": "Okay, we have a few other examples of how you can use the phrase claim to.", "start": 531.9, "end": 536.94}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 538.62, "end": 539.44}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 549.94, "end": 551.14}, {"text": "", "start": 551.14, "end": 551.14}, {"text": "The criminals claim to have a gun.", "start": 555.32, "end": 557.64}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 562.1800000000001, "end": 562.94}, {"text": "This man here is claiming to know your father.", "start": 566.0400000000001, "end": 568.56}, {"text": "That's such a great phrase.", "start": 571.72, "end": 573.16}, {"text": "Just by putting it together with another verb means something different, but still expresses that same idea.", "start": 573.4, "end": 579.6}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 579.8, "end": 579.94}, {"text": "Claim to have.", "start": 580.1, "end": 580.96}, {"text": "She claimed to have a baby or something.", "start": 581.16, "end": 583.48}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 583.7, "end": 583.86}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 584.2, "end": 584.36}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 584.56, "end": 584.82}, {"text": "So let's move to our next phrase.", "start": 584.82, "end": 586.48}, {"text": "Under heavy.", "start": 587.36, "end": 587.98}, {"text": "Under heavy.", "start": 588.64, "end": 589.68}, {"text": "Under heavy.", "start": 590.24, "end": 591.24}, {"text": "So in the dialogue, they said we're under heavy attack.", "start": 591.24, "end": 594.6}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 594.88, "end": 595.26}, {"text": "You can also use this phrase in a couple of other ways.", "start": 595.58, "end": 598.48}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 600.38, "end": 601.4}, {"text": "We're in the heavy attack.", "start": 603.4, "end": 604.94}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 608.2, "end": 609.16}, {"text": "We're under heavy fire.", "start": 611.28, "end": 612.68}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 615.38, "end": 616.4}, {"text": "The prime minister is under heavy security.", "start": 618.16, "end": 620.76}, {"text": "So if you're under heavy fire.", "start": 622.54, "end": 624.7}, {"text": "Means that there's a lot of fire.", "start": 624.94, "end": 626.54}, {"text": "Like gunfire.", "start": 626.76, "end": 627.52}, {"text": "Gunfire.", "start": 627.74, "end": 628.02}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 628.16, "end": 628.26}, {"text": "Not like fire fire.", "start": 628.5, "end": 629.54}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 629.94, "end": 630.24}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 630.86, "end": 631.14}, {"text": "And if you're under heavy security.", "start": 631.36, "end": 634.02}, {"text": "It means that you have a lot of security.", "start": 634.38, "end": 636.26}, {"text": "A lot of bodyguards or a lot of.", "start": 636.26, "end": 637.98}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 638.38, "end": 638.86}, {"text": "Like a prime minister or president would be under heavy security.", "start": 638.86, "end": 641.72}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 641.96, "end": 642.2}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 642.54, "end": 642.78}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 643.04, "end": 643.3}, {"text": "A couple of great phrases.", "start": 643.5, "end": 644.44}, {"text": "Really good phrases.", "start": 644.82, "end": 645.88}, {"text": "And with this, we can listen to our dialogue a third time.", "start": 645.9, "end": 648.84}, {"text": "Santa Claus.", "start": 653.52, "end": 654.56}, {"text": "Really, fellas.", "start": 659.64, "end": 660.56}, {"text": "You can't take me to jail.", "start": 660.86, "end": 662.3}, {"text": "Don't you know who I am?", "start": 662.56, "end": 664.02}, {"text": "Kris Kringle, you know.", "start": 664.24, "end": 665.58}, {"text": "Papa Noel.", "start": 665.94, "end": 666.86}, {"text": "Perry Noel.", "start": 667.14, "end": 667.76}, {"text": "Baba Natale.", "start": 668.12, "end": 668.94}, {"text": "Shung down, Lord.", "start": 669.2, "end": 669.74}, {"text": "Yeah, yeah.", "start": 669.74, "end": 670.88}, {"text": "We've heard that one before.", "start": 670.88, "end": 672.24}, {"text": "Haven't we, Joe?", "start": 672.4, "end": 673.08}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 673.88, "end": 674.14}, {"text": "Last week, we booked this guy who claimed to be a tooth fairy.", "start": 674.4, "end": 676.72}, {"text": "Can you believe that?", "start": 676.98, "end": 677.9}, {"text": "It's Christmas Eve, and I have all these presents to deliver.", "start": 679.66, "end": 683.0}, {"text": "Where's your Christmas spirit?", "start": 683.7, "end": 685.28}, {"text": "What'll happen when all the children wake up tomorrow and don't find any gifts on their stockings?", "start": 685.7, "end": 690.88}, {"text": "Sorry, buddy.", "start": 691.64, "end": 692.46}, {"text": "You were parked in a no-parking zone.", "start": 692.6, "end": 694.12}, {"text": "You were speeding, and you have no ID.", "start": 694.24, "end": 696.84}, {"text": "Besides that, even if we let you go now, your sleigh's been impounded, and those reindeer were taken to the city zoo.", "start": 697.56, "end": 702.84}, {"text": "What?", "start": 703.84, "end": 704.32}, {"text": "This is unbelievable.", "start": 705.14, "end": 706.5}, {"text": "What's this world coming to?", "start": 707.38, "end": 709.08}, {"text": "Christmas is ruined.", "start": 709.66, "end": 711.06}, {"text": "What's that up ahead?", "start": 711.52, "end": 712.48}, {"text": "It looks like...", "start": 712.68, "end": 713.86}, {"text": "Elves!", "start": 714.8, "end": 715.28}, {"text": "Whoa!", "start": 715.92, "end": 716.4}, {"text": "They're shooting candy canes!", "start": 716.62, "end": 717.7}, {"text": "Mayday!", "start": 718.38, "end": 718.86}, {"text": "Mayday!", "start": 718.98, "end": 719.26}, {"text": "We're under heavy attack!", "start": 719.36, "end": 720.18}, {"text": "We need backup!", "start": 720.18, "end": 721.06}, {"text": "So, Marco, the police mentioned something about the tooth fairy.", "start": 732.16, "end": 736.34}, {"text": "The tooth fairy.", "start": 736.68, "end": 737.56}, {"text": "I don't know.", "start": 737.8, "end": 738.3}, {"text": "Maybe some of our listeners don't know this story about the tooth fairy.", "start": 738.42, "end": 741.78}, {"text": "So, can I go ahead and say it?", "start": 742.0, "end": 744.44}, {"text": "Yes, go ahead.", "start": 744.52, "end": 745.4}, {"text": "Okay, well, when you're small, and you lose a tooth...", "start": 745.58, "end": 748.54}, {"text": "Your baby teeth.", "start": 748.54, "end": 749.26}, {"text": "Yeah, you put it underneath your pillow.", "start": 749.26, "end": 751.4}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 751.6, "end": 752.04}, {"text": "And then you go to sleep.", "start": 752.3, "end": 753.18}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 753.42, "end": 753.7}, {"text": "And then in the night, the tooth fairy comes into the house, flies into the house, sneaks under your pillow, takes the tooth, and puts money there.", "start": 753.84, "end": 762.98}, {"text": "Ah, I see.", "start": 763.16, "end": 764.02}, {"text": "So, this is a story that parents tell their kids about what happens to their baby teeth.", "start": 764.02, "end": 768.52}, {"text": "And they get money in exchange for it.", "start": 768.66, "end": 770.16}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 770.16, "end": 770.44}, {"text": "So, I guess it takes away the sadness of losing that tooth.", "start": 770.6, "end": 773.18}, {"text": "Yeah, yeah.", "start": 773.42, "end": 773.88}, {"text": "But in South America, for example, we have the tooth mouse.", "start": 774.18, "end": 778.86}, {"text": "The tooth mouse?", "start": 779.2, "end": 780.04}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 780.16, "end": 780.44}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 780.66, "end": 780.88}, {"text": "The tooth mouse.", "start": 781.0, "end": 781.22}, {"text": "What is it?", "start": 781.38, "end": 781.92}, {"text": "How is it called in Spanish?", "start": 781.98, "end": 783.3}, {"text": "Oh, well, in some places it's called ratoncito Perez.", "start": 783.5, "end": 786.68}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 787.08, "end": 787.36}, {"text": "Like, it has a last name, Perez.", "start": 787.36, "end": 789.12}, {"text": "Oh, really?", "start": 789.5, "end": 789.84}, {"text": "In other places, it's just called ratoncito, raton, which means mouse.", "start": 790.18, "end": 794.42}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 794.68, "end": 794.86}, {"text": "So, it'd be like Tooth Fairy Smith.", "start": 794.92, "end": 796.4}, {"text": "Yeah, Tooth Fairy Smith.", "start": 797.0, "end": 798.26}, {"text": "And it's the same thing.", "start": 798.66, "end": 799.72}, {"text": "It's a little mouse that comes in and steals a little tooth from you and leaves money in exchange.", "start": 799.82, "end": 804.26}, {"text": "Cool.", "start": 804.82, "end": 805.22}, {"text": "Very cool.", "start": 805.38, "end": 805.78}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 805.88, "end": 806.06}, {"text": "So, we go from Santa Claus to Guns and Wars to the Tooth Fairy.", "start": 806.06, "end": 810.54}, {"text": "Only at EnglishPod.", "start": 810.86, "end": 811.94}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 812.12, "end": 812.52}, {"text": "All right, guys.", "start": 813.1, "end": 813.88}, {"text": "I hope you enjoyed today's lesson.", "start": 813.9, "end": 815.36}, {"text": "If you have any questions or comments about the lesson, please visit our website, englishpod.com.", "start": 815.38, "end": 821.48}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 821.62, "end": 822.12}, {"text": "Well, we're out of time.", "start": 822.18, "end": 822.96}, {"text": "We've got to go.", "start": 822.96, "end": 823.72}, {"text": "We've got some Christmas shopping to do.", "start": 823.84, "end": 825.56}, {"text": "Yes, Christmas shopping.", "start": 825.68, "end": 826.58}, {"text": "So, we'll see you guys later.", "start": 826.78, "end": 828.24}, {"text": "And until then, it's...", "start": 828.46, "end": 829.66}, {"text": "Goodbye.", "start": 829.66, "end": 829.94}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 830.14, "end": 830.28}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 836.06, "end": 836.08}]